{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000cab7","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0abc2-42f2-7250-afbe-0f50f97f1bdf"},"sequence":950,"recorded_at":1780531400001895,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"e1f5c30b-1aa7-4c3a-b177-a44d7d5421ad","payload_type":"tool.result","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"tool_result","command_id":"e1f5c30b-1aa7-4c3a-b177-a44d7d5421ad","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"e1f5c30b-1aa7-4c3a-b177-a44d7d5421ad"},"call_id":"call_01a0abc5659e75a5ad3687ad9f9e132a","text":"Read text file `internal/sessquery/rev8_regression_test.go`.\n(249 line(s) above)\n250|\t_ = announced\n251|\tappendEventAs(t, local, idA, announced, \"lease.transferred\", 1, 2, leaseB, map[string]any{\"operation_id\": hostB, \"from_host_id\": hostA, \"to_host_id\": hostA, \"predecessor_lease_id\": lease, \"new_lease_id\": leaseB})\n252|\tr := &Reader{Local: local, LocalHostID: hostA}\n253|\twithCheckpoints(r, cp)\n254|\twithLeases(r, leaseCreate(t, idA, hostA), leaseSuccessorBytes(t, idA, 2, leaseB, hostA, lease, checkpointDigestOf(t, cp)))\n255|\trev7CheckEntries(t, r, false)\n256|}\n257|\n258|// TestRev8ProfileSourceRefusals drives one corrupt history per\n259|// rejected source class through all four shared entries: a source\n260|// naming a non-change event, a superseded change, a stale creation\n261|// value, a wrong first-launch profile, a dangling resume source, a\n262|// cross-session change, a losing-lease preserved change, and a\n263|// dangling closure predecessor. A citation of a well-formed later\n264|// local-only digest from inside the closure has no fixture: chain\n265|// continuity forces every prior event into the closure, so a\n266|// writer cannot cite its future; the historical control below\n267|// proves later events are never consulted instead.\n268|func TestRev8ProfileSourceRefusals(t *testing.T) {\n269|\tbuilders := map[string]func(t *testing.T) *Reader{\n270|\t\t\"wrong_type\": func(t *testing.T) 