{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000ddb5","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0abc2-42f2-7250-afbe-0f50f97f1bdf"},"sequence":3381,"recorded_at":1780531400006757,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"e1f5c30b-1aa7-4c3a-b177-a44d7d5421ad","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"e1f5c30b-1aa7-4c3a-b177-a44d7d5421ad","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"e1f5c30b-1aa7-4c3a-b177-a44d7d5421ad"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0abee-644d-7d92-b3ea-c758521463dc"},"task_id":"01a0abee-644d-7d92-b3ea-c758521463dc","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0abee-644d-7d92-b3ea-c758521463dc","chunk":"Read text file `internal/sessquery/TRACEABILITY.md`.\n(119 line(s) above)\n120|copied bytes. It has before/after green controls, a harmless\n121|comment control that must survive through the same instrument, a\n122|not-applied control, and a compile-failure control. The latter two\n123|prove no behavioral kill. The battery holds 60 unique N/B plants\n124|(57 N, 3 B): 43 semantic-admission plants whose kill is a\n125|behavioral admission failure, and 17 label/class/output-precision\n126|plants (the 3 B output-order plants plus 14 N plants including\n127|N-checkpoint-heads, whose kill pins error class/order through the\n128|profile backstop rather than semantic admission). The three\n129|classifier controls report separately and never join the kill\n130|numerator. Measured runs and per-mutant tables are\n131|attached on the task, never hard-coded as a green claim here. No\n132|new source-text gate lacks its token-preserving mutant: the `@`,\n133|`local`, `id:`, and alias-equality tokens each carry one, the\n134|capability-vocabulary gate carries the invented-name admission plus\n135|the full seven-name positive that preserves every searched-for\n136|token through the behavioral suite, and the profile discriminator\n137|carries the from-for-to derivation mutant that preserves the\n138|`profile.changed` match and the `to` read while changing which\n139|member supplies authority.\n140|\n141|The read and revalidation entries perform no durable writes. The crash\n142|test interrupts the real repository create after record installation,\n143|inspects the parked projection, retries the byte-identical create\n144|through its owner, and observes the healed read. Repeated lists and\n(more lines below)","final_result":true}}}
