ure, and 17 label/class/output-precision\n+plants (the 3 B output-order plants plus 14 N plants including\n+N-checkpoint-heads, whose kill pins error class/order through the\n+profile backstop rather than semantic admission). The three\n+classifier controls report separately and never join the kill\n+numerator. Measured runs and per-mutant tables are\n+attached on the task, never hard-coded as a green claim here. No\n+new source-text gate lacks its token-preserving mutant: the `@`,\n+`local`, `id:`, and alias-equality tokens each carry one, the\n+capability-vocabulary gate carries the invented-name admission plus\n+the full seven-name positive that preserves every searched-for\n+token through the behavioral suite, the profile discriminator\n+carries the from-for-to derivation mutant that preserves the\n+`profile.changed` match and the `to` read while changing which\n+member supplies authority, and the record-consumption census gate\n+carries the three N-referenced narrowing mutants that preserve\n+every searched-for call token while admitting one invalid\n+referenced member each.\n","final_result":true}}}
